<title>SINGAPORE: STIC buys total control of Sing Food.</title>
<headline>STIC buys total control of Sing Food.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp said on Monday it bought all oustanding ordinary shares in its unit, Singapore Food Industries, for a total cost of Singapore $69.82 million.</p>
<p>The company bought seven million shares from Temasek Holdings Pte Ltd for S$62.02 million, and 888,800 shares from Singapore Technologies Pte Ltd for S$7.8 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-870-3087</p>
</text>
